#N canvas 100 100 620 380 12;
#X text 20 10 fallingstar_source <name>: fallingstar as a spatialized source in a slot (opened by whistle-spawn or the game). Values come on <name>-whistle-source: alive 1 starts the stars \, distance <tiles> \, pos \, range \, width \, curve. To end it from here send "<name> alive 0" to whistle-source.;
#X obj 20 90 r \$1-whistle-source;
#X obj 20 120 route alive;
#X obj 20 160 fallingstar;
#X obj 20 200 *~ 0.4;
#X obj 120 200 *~ 0.4;
#X obj 20 240 outlet~;
#X obj 120 240 outlet~;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 3 1 5 0;
#X connect 4 0 6 0;
#X connect 5 0 7 0;
